{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSSwitchItem"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","title":"OUDSSwitchItem","externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents14OUDSSwitchItemV","platforms":[{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0"},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iPadOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0"},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0"},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"13.0"},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"16.0"},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"1.0"},{"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"11.0"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSSwitchItem"}],"symbolKind":"struct"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSSwitchItem","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Controls"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Layouts","text":"Layouts"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component can be rendered as two different layouts:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the component has a leading indicator, a label and optional texts, and an optional trailing decorative icon"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"inverse","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": like the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" layout but with a trailing switch indicator and a leading optional decorative icon"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Edge-To-Edge","text":"Edge To Edge"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The item can be used as edge to edge, means it is designed to span the full width of the screen so a default horizontal padding equal to margin is added."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In other case it is adapted for use within constrained layouts or containers with their own padding."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To control the edge to edge usage, call "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/SwiftUICore\/View\/isEdgeToEdge(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" on top of view containing the items."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Indicator-states","text":"Indicator states"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The switch indicator has two available states set as a boolean property that determines whether the toggle is on or off."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Particular-cases","text":"Particular cases"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSwitchItem","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be related to an error situation, for example troubles for a form."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A dedicated look and feel is implemented for that if the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isError"},{"type":"text","text":" flag is risen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In that case if the component displayed an icon, this icon will be replaced automatically by an error icon."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In addition, the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSwitchItem","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" can be in read only mode, i.e. the user cannot interact with the component yet but this component must not be considered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as disabled."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Voice Over","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" will use several elements to describe the component: if component disabled \/ read only, if error context, the label and optional texts and a custom switch trait."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Forbidden-by-design","text":"Forbidden by design"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The design system does not allow to have both an error situation and a read only component.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The design system does not allow to have both an error situation and a disabled component.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"The design system does not allow to have both a read only and a disabled component.","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Supposing we have an unselected state","    @Published var isOn: Bool = false","","    \/\/ A leading switch with a label.","    OUDSSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\", isOn: $isOn)","","    \/\/ Localizable from bundle can also be used","    OUDSSwitchItem(LocalizedStringKey(\"notifications_setting\"), bundle: Bundle.module, isOn: $isOn)","","    \/\/ A leading switch with a label, but in read only mode (user cannot interact yet, but not disabled).","    OUDSSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\", isOn: $isOn, isReadOnly: true)","","    \/\/ A leading switch with a label and a description text.","    OUDSSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\", isOn: $isOn, description: \"The Beatles\")","","    \/\/ A trailing switch with a label, a description and a tinted icon.","    OUDSSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\",","                   isOn: $isOn,","                   description: \"The Beatles\",","                   image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\")),","                   isReversed: true)","","    \/\/ A trailing switch with a raw (non-tinted) image.","    OUDSSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\",","                   isOn: $isOn,","                   description: \"The Beatles\",","                   image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"il_someImage\"), renderingMode: .original),","                   isReversed: true)","","    \/\/ Flip the icon for RTL layouts using OUDSImage.","    OUDSSwitchItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\",","                   isOn: $isOn,","                   image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"figure.handball\"),","                                   flipped: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft))","","    \/\/ If on error, add an error message to help user understand the error context","    OUDSSwitchItem(\"Rescue from this world!\",","                   isOn: $isOn,","                   isError: true,","                   errorText: .raw(\"Something wrong\"),","                   hasDivider: true)","","    \/\/ The error message is an OUDSTextualContent: raw (string literal), localized or rich text","    OUDSSwitchItem(\"Rescue from this world!\",","                   isOn: $isOn,","                   isError: true,","                   errorText: .localized(\"error_wording\", bundle: Bundle.module))","    OUDSSwitchItem(\"Rescue from this world!\",","                   isOn: $isOn,","                   isError: true,","                   errorText: .rich(AttributedString(markdown: \"You **must** enable it\"))) \/\/ Manage in your side errors for init","","    \/\/ A leading switch with a label, but disabled.","    OUDSSwitchItem(\"Rescue from this world!\", isOn: $isOn)","        .disabled(true)","","    \/\/ Never disable a read only or an error-related switch as it will crash","    \/\/ This is forbidden by design!","    OUDSSwitchItem(\"Kaboom!\", isOn: $isOn, isError: true).disabled(true) \/\/ fatal error","    OUDSSwitchItem(\"Kaboom!\", isOn: $isOn, isReadOnly: true).disabled(true) \/\/ fatal error"]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Rich-text","text":"Rich text"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich text can only be used for error messages."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The error message is an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextualContent","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":": a raw "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":" (a string literal is enough), a localized string"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".localized(_:tableName:bundle:)"},{"type":"text","text":" or a rich text with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".rich(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AttributedString"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Prefer "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".raw(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to a bare string literal for a raw message, so the compiler selects without any doubt the initializer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"taking an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextualContent","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and does not emit a deprecation warning."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Strong text can be used sparingly to highlight key information within the content."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No other text styles should be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined text must not be applied manually (e.g. in error message), as it is commonly associated with hyperlinks and may mislead users."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Always check the results of rich text mode with high contrast, light and dark modes, and Voice Over vocalization."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Design-documentation","text":"Design documentation"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-switch","isActive":true}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Themes-rendering","text":"Themes rendering"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Orange","text":"Orange"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_switchItem_Orange"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Orange-Compact","text":"Orange Compact"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_switchItem_OrangeCompact"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Sosh","text":"Sosh"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_switchItem_Sosh"}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Wireframe","text":"Wireframe"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_switchItem_Wireframe"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"1.5.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}]}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"0.14.0","type":"text"}]}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSwitchItem","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Switch item is a UI element that allows to toggle between two states, typically “On” and “Off”, and used to enable or disable features, options or settings."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Switch Item covers a wider range of contexts by allowing to toggle the visibility of additional text labels and icon assets."}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSwitchItem\/init(_:isOn:description:image:isReversed:isError:errorText:isReadOnly:hasDivider:constrainedMaxWidth:)-4yw94","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSwitchItem\/init(_:isOn:description:image:isReversed:isError:errorText:isReadOnly:hasDivider:constrainedMaxWidth:)-8jy7d","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSwitchItem\/init(_:isOn:description:image:isReversed:isError:errorText:isReadOnly:hasDivider:constrainedMaxWidth:)-92mad","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSwitchItem\/init(_:tableName:bundle:isOn:description:image:isReversed:isError:errorText:isReadOnly:hasDivider:constrainedMaxWidth:)-1aml9","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSwitchItem\/init(_:tableName:bundle:isOn:description:image:isReversed:isError:errorText:isReadOnly:hasDivider:constrainedMaxWidth:)-5dl6b","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSSwitchItem\/init(_:tableName:bundle:isOn:description:image:isReversed:isError:errorText:isReadOnly:hasDivider:constrainedMaxWidth:)-6cd03"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","title":"Instance Properties","generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSCompon